{
  "id": "lolin-s3-mini",
  "name": "LOLIN S3 Mini",
  "baseChip": "esp32s3",
  "pcb": "black",
  "notes": [
    "LOLIN (WEMOS) S3 Mini: 34.3 x 25.4 mm bare ESP32-S3FH4R2 (4 MB flash, 2 MB quad PSRAM), USB-C. The outer pin rows match the D1 mini footprint (shields fit); the inner rows are a second set of through-hole pads, drawn as the inboard strip here.",
    "GPIO35/36/37 are usable here (the PSRAM is quad, not octal) - 35/36 are even the default I2C. The bare chip also exposes GPIO33/34, which WROOM modules keep for themselves. The WS2812B RGB LED sits on GPIO47 (not broken out).",
    "Native USB only, no serial bridge: hold BOOT (GPIO0, not broken out) and tap RST for download mode. Arduino defaults: TX=43, RX=44, SDA=35, SCL=36, SPI SCK=12 / MISO=13 / MOSI=11 / SS=10."
  ],
